  "bio": "Zihae is an extraordinarily skilled tattoo artist who specializes in sketch and fineline styles. With a substantial following of approximately 92,000 on Instagram, their mastery in their craft is widely acknowledged. They navigate the complex worlds of light and dark with their exquisite designs, effortlessly bringing any concept to life on skin. Despite their high proficiency level, Zihae is extremely professional, maintaining a clean and safe environment at Studio Yasaeng.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location:\n\n𝐎𝐮𝐫 𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐥𝐝 𝐡𝐮𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐮𝐬, 𝐛𝐮𝐭 𝐢𝐭'𝐬 𝐚𝐥𝐬𝐨 𝐬𝐨 𝐛𝐞𝐚𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐮𝐥\n@come.to.nest Based in seoul\nAPL - JUN📍EU / UK / CA\n✉️𝙕𝙞𝙝𝙖𝙚𝙨𝙩𝙖𝙡𝙚@𝙜𝙢𝙖𝙞𝙡.𝙘𝙤𝙢\n\n𝐎𝐮𝐫 𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐥𝐝 𝐡𝐮𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐮𝐬, 𝐛𝐮𝐭 𝐢𝐭'𝐬 𝐚𝐥𝐬𝐨 𝐬𝐨 𝐛𝐞𝐚𝐮𝐭𝐢𝐟𝐮𝐥\n@come.to.nest Based in seoul\nAPL - JUN📍EU / UK / CA\n✉️𝙕𝙞𝙝𝙖𝙚𝙨𝙩𝙖𝙡𝙚@𝙜𝙢𝙖𝙞𝙡.𝙘𝙤𝙢",
